City Strategy 29
Streamline and Coordinate the
Permitting Process
Project Leader:     City
Logical Partners:  Outside Experts
Need
Complaints about the building permit process in
Cheyenne – especially for historic preservation and
retrofit – focus on conflicting, unclear language and
differing interpretations, at different times, from
different – or the same -- departments.  Frustration
must not be part of downtown’s rebirth.
Adopting the Unified Development Code – another
step in PlanCheyenne – eases some confusion.
However, owners can be dazed by mechanical,
energy, fire prevention, historic and streetscape
