Hole’s version and Wyoming statutes.  Prepare preliminary
recommendations.
2  Review land statistics gathered for the major infill
development exercise.  Show public and private
ownerships, add rights-of-way, overlay other popular
urban places.  Does this warrant a Cheyenne-style CLT?
3  Prepare a test case on vacant City, County and State
